// --------------------
// The AES decipher round. A pure combinational module that implements
// the initial round, main round and final round logic for
// decciper operations.
//
//
// Author: Joachim Strombergson
// Copyright (c) 2013, 2014, Secworks Sweden AB
// All rights reserved.
//
